# workmon-collect hosts — one worker per line: <host_or_wg_ip> [asset_id]
# Copy this to /etc/workmon-collect/hosts and edit it.
#
# asset_id (the second column) is OPTIONAL. If not set, the receiving folder name
# is taken from the worker hostname (short name, `hostname -s`), which should be
# made unique per user during hardware provisioning.
# The second column is only needed to force an override.

# Just WG addresses; names will come from the workers' hostnames:
# 10.10.0.11
# 10.10.0.12
# 10.10.0.13

# With an explicit folder-name override:
# 10.10.0.20   special-kiosk
